{"id":"pausa","lemma":"pausa","pos":"noun","rank":3520,"glosses":["break, pause, rest"],"ipa":"/ˈpausa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"pausas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c9/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-pausa.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es hora de una pausa.","en":"It's time for a break.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461535","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"hour"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Hagamos una pausa de diez minutos.","en":"Let's take a 10-minute break.","words":[{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"A"},{"g":"minute","l":"minuto"}]},{"text":"¿Qué te parece hacer una pausa para el café?","en":"What do you say to having a coffee break?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1253468","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to seem, to see fit","l":"parecer"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"coffee"}]},{"text":"¿Te importaría si me doy una pausa?","en":"Would you mind if I took a break?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to matter","l":"importar"},{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Tom necesita una pausa.","en":"Tom needs a break.","words":[null,{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}